        "date": "2026-11-10T16:55:48Z"
      },
      "message": "docs(process): the camcraft-mcp skill's tool signatures match the server, pinned by a drift test (#724)\n\nEight entries in .claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md named arguments the\nserver refuses (post path -> output, add_operation model -> source,\nset_stock's kind/corner-array shape -> box {dx, dy, dz} / cylinder /\nfrom_model, set_operation_area and set_operation_geometry name ->\noperation (area is one object), set_work_offset offset -> word,\nload_machine name -> builtin/path/clear, add_tool name -> catalog). The\nKnown Remaining Gaps list is brought current: pocket recognition, in-plane\npart axes and the live GUI session have shipped; MoveModel and RepairModel\nare open PRs #719 and #721.\n\ncrates/app/tests/mcp_skill_signatures.rs checks every documented signature\nagainst tools/list (tool exists, keys are real, required keys written).\nPROCESS_VERSION 4 -> 5.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
