      "message": "Merge main into issue/724-mcp-skill-signatures; drop the drift test\n\nConflicts: .claude/PROCESS_VERSION (main 9, this PR changes a process\nfile -> 10) and the camcraft-mcp skill's gap note (keep this PR's\ncurrent gap list and main's `P1` + `area:mcp` label rule).\n\nAt the maintainer's request (2026-11-10: \"no need to make a drift test on\nprocess files and skills\"), crates/app/tests/mcp_skill_signatures.rs is\nremoved and the decision file says so. #719 and #721 merged meanwhile,\nso `move_model` and `repair_model` move from \"Known Remaining Gaps\" to\nthe tool reference.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
